WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
From plain language to a runnable model.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.000
The deterministic compiler identifies p53 and Mdm2 as species.

3
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Each supported statement becomes a process card with its evidence quote.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:26.000
The process fluxes assemble into explicit ordinary differential equations.

5
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.000
The interaction graph is derived from those equations, not drawn independently.

6
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:38.000
The app integrates the equations to obtain p53 and Mdm2 trajectories.

7
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Coverage, Jacobian signs, and numerical simulation all pass verification.
